---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import portraitImg from '../assets/florian-portrait.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Florian Obermeier — Autor"
  description="Zwei Bücher, zwei Pole. Florian Obermeier schreibt über Technologie, die die Welt verändert — und über das, was unter dem Lärm liegt."
  lang="de"
  alternateUrl="/en/"
>

<style>
  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 6rem 2.5rem 4rem;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--teal);
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 9vw, 6.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .hero h1 .amp {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    padding: 0 0.1em;
  }
  .hero h1 .stille {
    font-style: italic;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--gold) 30%, #f5d28e 70%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--text);
    max-width: 600px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .hero-sub em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, background 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  }
  .btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--teal);
    background: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .btn .arrow {
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }
  .btn:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(3px); }
  .btn--ghost {
    border-color: transparent;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .btn--ghost:hover {
    color: var(--text-heading);
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    background: transparent;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow,
  .hero h1,
  .hero-sub,
  .hero-cta {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Portrait — right-side bleed, feathered mask, duotone tint, grain */
  .hero-portrait {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    right: calc(50% - 50vw);
    width: min(720px, 60vw);
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, transparent 16%, rgba(0,0,0,0.32) 36%, rgba(0,0,0,0.78) 58%, #000 76%);
            mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, transparent 16%, rgba(0,0,0,0.32) 36%, rgba(0,0,0,0.78) 58%, #000 76%);
  }
  .hero-portrait picture {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .hero-portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 32%;
    filter: saturate(0.72) contrast(1.06) brightness(0.86);
    transform: scale(1.06);
    transform-origin: 50% 25%;
    display: block;
  }
  .hero-portrait::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(72% 55% at 65% 22%, rgba(232, 169, 72, 0.32), transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(60% 65% at 32% 80%, rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.18), transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 30%, rgba(10,10,11,0.45) 100%);
    mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-portrait-grain {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    opacity: 0.22;
    mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @supports (animation-timeline: scroll()) {
    .hero-portrait img {
      animation: hero-portrait-drift linear both;
      animation-timeline: scroll(root block);
      animation-range: 0 90vh;
    }
    @keyframes hero-portrait-drift {
      from { transform: translateY(-1.5%) scale(1.06); }
      to   { transform: translateY(5%) scale(1.09); }
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-portrait img {
      animation: none;
      transform: scale(1.06);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) and (max-width: 1023px) {
    .hero-portrait {
      width: min(440px, 48vw);
      opacity: 0.78;
      -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, transparent 26%, rgba(0,0,0,0.28) 48%, rgba(0,0,0,0.72) 70%, #000 86%);
              mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, transparent 26%, rgba(0,0,0,0.28) 48%, rgba(0,0,0,0.72) 70%, #000 86%);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero { padding: 7rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
    .hero-portrait {
      top: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0;
      width: 100%;
      opacity: 0.32;
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(82% 65% at 75% 25%, #000 0%, transparent 62%);
              mask-image: radial-gradient(82% 65% at 75% 25%, #000 0%, transparent 62%);
    }
    .hero-portrait img {
      filter: saturate(0.55) contrast(1.05) brightness(0.55) blur(2px);
    }
  }

  /* SECTION SHELL */
  section.block {
    padding: 7rem 2.5rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .section-label::before {
    content: '';
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--text-dim);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    section.block { padding: 4.5rem 1.25rem; }
    .section-label { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  }

  /* BOOKS */
  .books-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .books-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3.5rem; }
  }

  .book-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    transition: border-color 0.5s, transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), box-shadow 0.5s;
    position: relative;
  }
  .book-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 18px;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.5s;
    background: radial-gradient(600px circle at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 50%), rgba(255,255,255,0.05), transparent 40%);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .book-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .book-card--signal:hover { border-color: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.35); box-shadow: 0 25px 60px -20px rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.18); }
  .book-card--stille:hover { border-color: rgba(232, 169, 72, 0.32); box-shadow: 0 25px 60px -20px rgba(232, 169, 72, 0.18); }

  .cover {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1071 / 1700;
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    background: #060308;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .cover img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
  }
  .book-card:hover .cover img { transform: scale(1.03); }

  .release-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.4rem;
    right: 1.4rem;
    width: 78px;
    height: 78px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #0a0a0b;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.25;
    transform: rotate(8deg);
    z-index: 3;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 28px rgba(232, 169, 72, 0.5);
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .badge-pre {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
  .badge-date {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .book-info {
    padding: 1.75rem 1.75rem 2rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .book-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .book-tag::before {
    content: '';
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .book-tag--signal { color: var(--teal); }
  .book-tag--signal::before { background: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--teal); }
  .book-tag--stille { color: var(--gold); }
  .book-tag--stille::before { background: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--gold); }

  .book-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .book-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .book-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .book-meta {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .book-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* COUNTDOWN */
  .countdown {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .countdown-unit {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .countdown-num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 2ch;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .countdown-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .countdown-done {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  /* ABOUT */
  .about {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .about-lead {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.95rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .about-lead em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .about p {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .about p strong {
    color: var(--text-heading);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* NEWSLETTER */
  .newsletter-inner { max-width: 560px; }
  .newsletter-headline {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .newsletter-headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .newsletter-sub {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .newsletter-sub em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .nl-field {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .nl-input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 180px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .nl-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-dim); }
  .nl-input:focus { border-color: var(--teal); }
  .nl-status {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    min-height: 1.4em;
  }
  .nl-status--ok { color: var(--teal); }
  .nl-status--err { color: #f87171; }

  /* CONTACT / CTA */
  .contact {
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 7rem;
  }
  .contact-headline {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .contact-headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--teal);
  }
  .contact-sub {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .contact-mail {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .contact-mail:hover {
    border-color: var(--teal);
    color: var(--teal);
  }
  .contact-socials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
</style>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Florian Obermeier — Autor</p>
  <h1>Signal<span class="amp"> &amp; </span><span class="stille">Stille</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Zwei Bücher, zwei Pole. Das eine erklärt eine Technologie, die die Welt verändert. Das andere sucht nach <em>dem, was darunter liegt</em>, wenn der Lärm verstummt.</p>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a href="#buecher" class="btn">Bücher entdecken <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    <a href="#ueber" class="btn btn--ghost">Über mich</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-portrait" aria-hidden="true">
    <Picture
      src={portraitImg}
      formats={['avif', 'webp']}
      widths={[400, 600, 800, 1100, 1440]}
      sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1023px) 48vw, min(720px, 60vw)"
      alt=""
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <svg class="hero-portrait-grain" viewBox="0 0 200 200" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <filter id="hp-noise">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.85" numOctaves="2" stitchTiles="stitch" />
        <feColorMatrix type="saturate" values="0" />
        <feComponentTransfer><feFuncA type="linear" slope="1" intercept="-0.5" /></feComponentTransfer>
      </filter>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(#hp-noise)" />
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BOOKS -->
<section id="buecher" class="block">
  <p class="section-label reveal">Zwei Bücher</p>
  <div class="books-grid">

    <!-- BOOK 1: Signal -->
    <article class="book-card book-card--signal reveal" data-tilt>
      <div class="cover cover--ki">
        <img src="/cover-ki.jpg" alt="Cover: Warum KI kein Hype ist" width="1200" height="1905" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="book-info">
        <p class="book-tag book-tag--signal">Signal — Sachbuch</p>
        <h2 class="book-title">Warum KI kein Hype ist</h2>
        <p class="book-subtitle">und wie sie unseren Alltag grundlegend verändert</p>
        <p class="book-desc">
          Kein Forscher, kein Entwickler — aber jemand, der IT von innen kennt: über zehn Jahre als Teamleiter und Manager in der Branche. Ende 2022 hat er ChatGPT geöffnet und gemerkt: das ist nicht der nächste Trend. 2024 hat er sich im Silicon Valley angeschaut, wer das eigentlich baut und warum. Daraus sind 586 Seiten geworden: was KI heute kann, und wohin das in den nächsten Jahren führt. Für alle, die den Hype kennen — und endlich wissen wollen, was wirklich dahintersteckt.
        </p>
        <p class="book-meta">2025 · 586 Seiten · BoD · ISBN 978-3-6951-7324-2</p>
        <div class="book-actions">
          <a href="https://www.amazon.de/Warum-kein-Hype-ist-grundlegend/dp/3695173246" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bei Amazon <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
          <a href="https://buchshop.bod.de/warum-ki-kein-hype-ist-florian-obermeier-9783695173242" class="btn btn--ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BoD ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- BOOK 2: Stille -->
    <article class="book-card book-card--stille reveal" data-tilt>
      <div class="cover">
        <img src="/cover-stille.jpg" alt="Cover: Du hörst es erst, wenn es still wird" width="1071" height="1700" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="release-badge" aria-label="Erscheint 30. Mai">
          <span class="badge-pre">AB</span>
          <span class="badge-date">30. MAI</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="book-info">
        <p class="book-tag book-tag--stille">Stille — Memoir mit Soundtrack</p>
        <h2 class="book-title">Du hörst es erst, wenn es still wird</h2>
        <p class="book-subtitle">Ein Buch mit Soundtrack</p>
        <p class="book-desc">
          Alles lief. Der Job, der Kalender, die Rolle, in der niemand auf die Idee käme zu fragen. Bis der Körper anfängt, Dinge zu tun, die sich nicht mehr erklären lassen. Ein Protokoll des Wegs durch die Stille. Dazu 16 Songs: einer für jedes der 13 Kapitel, drei weitere, die dazugehören. Selbst geschrieben und mit Suno produziert, weil manche Dinge sich nicht schreiben, sondern nur hören lassen.
        </p>
        <p class="book-meta">Erscheint 30. Mai 2026 · 13 Kapitel · 16 Songs · BoD</p>
        <div class="countdown" id="countdown-stille" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="countdown-unit">
            <span class="countdown-num" id="cd-days">--</span>
            <span class="countdown-label">Tage</span>
          </div>
          <div class="countdown-unit">
            <span class="countdown-num" id="cd-hours">--</span>
            <span class="countdown-label">Std</span>
          </div>
          <div class="countdown-unit">
            <span class="countdown-num" id="cd-mins">--</span>
            <span class="countdown-label">Min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="countdown-unit">
            <span class="countdown-num" id="cd-secs">--</span>
            <span class="countdown-label">Sek</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="book-actions">
          <a href="mailto:kontakt@florian-obermeier.com?subject=Du%20h%C3%B6rst%20es%20erst%2C%20wenn%20es%20still%20wird" class="btn">Anfragen <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- RELEASE REMINDER -->
<section id="erinnerung" class="block">
  <p class="section-label reveal">Erscheint bald</p>
  <div class="newsletter-inner">
    <h2 class="newsletter-headline reveal">Sei dabei, wenn es <em>still</em> wird.</h2>
    <p class="newsletter-sub reveal">Am 30. Mai 2026 erscheint mein zweites Buch, <em>Du hörst es erst, wenn es still wird</em>. Trag deine E-Mail ein — ich erinnere dich, sobald es da ist. Kein Newsletter, keine Weitergabe.</p>
    <form class="reveal" id="nl-form" novalidate>
      <div class="nl-field">
        <input class="nl-input" type="email" id="nl-email" placeholder="deine@email.com" autocomplete="email" required />
        <button class="btn" type="submit">
          <span id="nl-btn-label">Erinner mich</span>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="nl-status" id="nl-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="ueber" class="block">
  <p class="section-label reveal">Über</p>
  <div class="about">
    <p class="about-lead reveal">
      Ich lebe im Bayerischen Wald. Dort, wo die Landkarte grün ist, wo Hügel den Blick beruhigen und Funklöcher oft schneller über Telefonate entscheiden als man selbst. Ein guter Ort zum <em>Nachdenken</em>.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      Lange war das nicht meine Welt. Job in IT und Sales, Projekte nebenher, beinahe jedes Wochenende unterwegs. Veranstaltungen, Konzerte. Immer laut, immer Trubel. Ich war der, den man anruft, wenn was laufen muss, und habe das nächste Ja meistens gesagt, bevor ich es überlegt hatte. Eine Weile hat sich das wie Leistung angefühlt. Bis mein Körper anderer Meinung war.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      Heute lebe ich bewusster. Ich höre öfter zu, bevor ich antworte. Auch mir selbst, was eigentlich das schwierigere von beidem ist.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      Was mich beschäftigt, lässt sich schlecht in eine Disziplin stecken. KI lässt mich seit Jahren nicht mehr los. Aber genauso die Frage, warum so viele Leute funktionieren, bis ihr Körper für sie entscheidet. Ich war einer davon.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      Ich glaube nicht, dass man immer stark sein muss. Aber daran, dass man nicht allein damit bleiben sollte.
    </p>
  </div>
